<BaseLayout title="Shipping Packaging for Peptides — Protecting the Vial in Transit" description="Packaging practice for research peptide shipments: vial cushioning, desiccation, phase-change materials, tamper evidence and label consistency with customs documents." canonical="/knowledge/peptide-shipping-packaging/">
